RozeLynx

=========================================
Portable Features Extension for Firefox
=========================================

This extension provides optional features originally developed for the Floorp
browser, adapted for RozeLynx. Each feature is controlled by a USE flag at
build time and is loaded as a separate module within this extension.

Features:
- chrome-web-store: Install extensions from Chrome Web Store
- experiments: A/B testing and feature flag system
- external-browser: Open links in other installed browsers
- i18n: Internationalization utilities
- mouse-gestures: Mouse gesture navigation
- qr-code: QR code generator for current URL
- pwa: Progressive Web App installation
- lepton-skin: Compact UI theme
- ip-protection: IP protection privacy overrides
